# Map build source data: ~95MB of full-state ZCTA GeoJSON (OpenDataDE),
# regenerable/re-fetchable, not something to carry in git history. Only the
# CSV, tools/build-map.js, and the built assets/map-tiers.svg are committed.
# See tools/build-map.js for how to regenerate assets/map-tiers.svg from
# these once they're back in place locally.
tools/data/*.json
